DTSTAMP:20261010T160842Z
DTSTART:20241229T175220Z
DTEND:20250101T003123Z
SUMMARY:🍅 Fruit day · ♐ Sagittarius
DESCRIPTION:Moon in Sagittarius (Fire)\n\nSowing & planting: Sow and plant 
 fruiting vegetables\, legumes\, grains and fruit trees.\nHarvesting: Harve
 st fruit and seed for storage and preserving\; collect seed for next seaso
 n.\nOther work: Prune fruit trees\, graft (best with an ascending moon)\, 
 hoe around fruiting crops.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
