SUMMARY:🍅 Fruit day · ♌ Leo
DESCRIPTION:Moon in Leo (Fire)\n\nSowing & planting: Sow and plant fruiting
  vegetables\, legumes\, grains and fruit trees.\nHarvesting: Harvest fruit
  and seed for storage and preserving\; collect seed for next season.\nOthe
 r work: Prune fruit trees\, graft (best with an ascending moon)\, hoe arou
 nd fruiting crops.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
